  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Guarantee Group (DGG) - Nautilus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Guarantee Group (DGG) catalyzes private investment in the regenerative and sustainable blue economy by providing de-risking solutions. Through guarantee instruments, DGG enhances the creditworthiness of ocean resilience projects, mobilizing capital from banks and institutional investors. By addressing investment risks, DGG facilitates access to lower-cost, long-term financing, promoting biodiversity-positive outcomes and climate-smart solutions. This model strengthens the financial viability of blue economy initiatives, supporting sustainable marine ecosystems, coastal communities, and global efforts toward economic and environmental resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
